{
  "_about": "Every field the brand page template uses. Path syntax: a.b for objects, a[] for each item of an array. 'count' = exact number of items, 'min'/'max' = item range for arrays, 'maxLen' = max characters for strings, 'optional' = may be empty until publish (QC warns instead of failing). Limits come from the Paper desktop + mobile layouts (C&S American Standard furnace brand page). Fields marked phone: true are the phone layout: optional, and when empty the page uses the desktop copy. Image fields hold https links to CC0 or public-domain photos (or City & Suburban's own), each recorded in meta.imageSources. hasDefault: true = may stay empty, the page shows a default (the service-area map, City & Suburban's van photo).",
